00:07:38.458 --> 00:07:40.460
but outside the Netherlands it's allowed.

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:42.462
Most of these security are ex-military.

00:07:42.462 --> 00:07:46.174
So they know a lot about
them, what they did before.

00:07:46.174 --> 00:07:47.717
If they're disciplined,

00:07:47.717 --> 00:07:48.759
if they can keep them out,

00:07:48.759 --> 00:07:50.595
shut what they see or notice.

00:07:56.851 --> 00:07:58.978
Yeah. I don't even know
why it's that coordinated

00:07:58.978 --> 00:08:00.354
with all kids of people, you know,

00:08:00.354 --> 00:08:02.148
put the chain into a soup,

00:08:02.148 --> 00:08:04.442
