00:08:35.598 --> 00:08:37.058
You won't make it.

00:08:37.058 --> 00:08:38.851
I would say a 5.

00:08:38.851 --> 00:08:40.228
I give it a 4.

00:08:40.228 --> 00:08:41.896
OK, here's the copy.

00:08:45.107 --> 00:08:46.943
